{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "満開っ!🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生の長嶋凛桜(ながしま りお)です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日も読みに来てくれてありがとう☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは、\n昨日のオンラインミート＆グリートありがとうございましたᡣ𐭩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobusmzji.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この日の髪型はプードルみたいなくるくるヘア🐩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "前に雑誌で咲月さんがしてい髪型が可愛かったので真似っ子してみたのです♪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mob8nwJ36.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ポニーテールもしてみたの"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobTG2XeL.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ふいーん\nﾅﾆｦｲｯﾃﾗｯｼｬﾙ(\")?"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "39枚目期間は\n以前から会いに来てくれていた皆さんとは\nもっとお話できて、よりお互いのことを知れて嬉しかったな"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーで私を見つけて会いに来てくれた方も沢山いらっしゃってありがとうの気持ちで胸がいっぱいです😭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見つけてくれてありがとう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "次に会えるのは12月だけど\nそれまでお互い元気でいようね☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "改めてまして39枚目、ありがとうございました❀.*ﾟ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は色々なお知らせが盛りだくさんで\nわくわくドキドキです!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "まずは〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "40thシングル 6期生個人PVの予告が配信されました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "タイトルは\n｢長嶋凛桜 感情図鑑｣"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "TYPE-Bに収録されます!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "元々感情の動きが少しだけ、いや、かなり？大きい方なのでいつもの自分をそのままPVにしていただいた感覚ですᡣ𐭩"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://youtu.be/A9mP0UndwJk?si=fiwFbvmWDc0dm-3Y"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "是非ご覧ください!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてのぎ動画にて｢Girl’s talk#前編｣が公開されました!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "川端晃菜、鈴木佑捺、長嶋凛桜の3人で乃木坂愛について熱く語っています!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ババロア、なまら美味しかった🤤"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobqVwJ8E.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しかったね"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "｢乃木坂工事中 大運動会 前編｣も配信中です!"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "設楽軍、日村軍､､､"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "果たして勝つのはどちらかっ！？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ぜひ観てくださいっ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近は紅葉を見たい気分です🍁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobSxWxl3.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": 